  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds XUnitAssured.RabbitMq: publish and consume steps for RabbitMQ on the official async client, with topology verbs, explicit rejection and dead-letter, and batch consume. Correctness fixes, no API changes: a verb that reconfigures a step no longer adds a second execution, and a step of another type always starts a new step; an explicitly configured Kafka broker or group is no longer discarded; authentication survives the Kafka consume verbs; a request that gets no answer reports the reason. Upgrade guide: https://github.com/andrewBezerra/xunit-assured-net/blob/main/UPGRADING.md",
